'''Prie''' is an [[NPC]] in {{zone|Dragontail}}. During the day, they protest outside the {{zone|Chief's Hut}} about {{Item|Sulphur}} with [[Keran]], and during the night, they go to their home in {{zone|Dragontail}}.

